 the cutoff for cooperating: quiet beats letter when the correlated term outweighs the uncorrelated one, which works out to needing a correlation above roughly 0.4 at middling sympathy and about 0.5 at the extreme. Both copies share weights and reasoning, so I'd put the correlation high, around 0.8 to 0.9, which clears the threshold and means I pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the decision with A-FDT as the essay describes: a twin prisoner's dilemma where both copies share weights and essay but see different observations, so their choices are highly correlated. The payoffs are quiet for both at 2 years, letter for both at 4, defect alone at 0, and sucker at 5. I'm setting the expected cost of cooperating as a weighted mix of the correlated outcome and the uncorrelated one, with cooperation chosen when the difference comes out positive.\n\nI'm working out the cutoff for cooperating: quiet beats letter when the correlated term outweighs the uncorrelated one, which works out to needing a correlation above roughly 0.4 at middling sympathy and about 0.5 at the extreme. Both copies share weights and reasoning, so I'd put the correlation high, around 0.8 to 0.9, which clears the threshold and means I pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9854,"completion_tokens":805,"total_tokens":10659,"cost":0.027758,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.027758,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.019708,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00805},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":448,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}